    "answer": "Meridian Textiles Ltd was incorporated in Malta on 2009-11-02.\n\nOn ultimate beneficial owner for Meridian Textiles Ltd, sources disagree: Meridian Textiles Ltd's ultimate beneficial owner on file is Devrim Holdings A.S., holding a 62% equity stake. Sayari's ownership graph traces only 48% of Meridian Textiles Ltd to Devrim Holdings A.S., with the remaining stake held through a nominee arrangement Sayari could not fully resolve.\n\nMeridian Textiles Ltd returned no match against the OFAC Specially Designated Nationals (SDN) list.\n\nSayari's risk screening rates Meridian Textiles Ltd as Elevated risk due to adverse media referencing a 2025 customs fraud investigation.",
